It's basically a blade, like a very sharp piece of metal that you use to cut hair.

138
00:06:55,640 --> 00:07:00,290
So the hair on your legs, the hair on your face, these are things that you cut with a razor.

139
00:07:00,990 --> 00:07:05,370
And men use razors to shave their faces, shave their chins or above their lip.

140
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,920
All right.

141
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:15,630
And well, actually, after we shave our beard, we put on a little bit of aftershave, which is basically kind of like alcohol that smells really nice.

142
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:22,640
That's right, because shaving can actually hurt your skin or the hairs under your skin can become really itchy or irritated.

143
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:26,040
And so aftershave helps make everything feel better.

144
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,040
Okay.

145
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:31,140
Well, and sometimes we also use a little bit of cologne to smell nice.

146
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:42,360
So women usually wear perfume, which is, you know, the perfumes like CK and Hugo Boss and all that stuff, as well as for guys, it's usually called cologne.

147
00:07:42,780 --> 00:07:43,320
Okay, that's right.

148
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:49,940
It's an important difference there because we don't say perfume for guys and we don't say cologne for girls.

149
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:52,940
So women wear perfume, like you said, but men wear cologne.

150
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:54,840
And this word is very funny looking.

151
00:07:55,440 --> 00:08:00,880
It ends with, it's spelled C-O-L-O-G-N-E.

152
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:03,200
So you don't really say the G, it's not cologna.

153
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:04,400
Right.

154
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:04,520
It's cologne.

155
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:08,440
And it's something that you put on your neck or your face to smell really good if you're a man.

156
00:08:09,200 --> 00:08:10,200
Exactly.

157
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:19,940
And finally, if you have long hair or maybe you have very spiky hair like I do, you need to wear a little bit of gel to kind of give your head a little bit of shape.

158
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:20,990
That's right.

159
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:23,610
So gel is actually the name of a kind of substance.

160
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:25,530
It's not liquid, but it's not hard either.

161
00:08:25,790 --> 00:08:31,130
And it's basically thick like paste that you put in your hair to keep it in one place.

162
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:37,250
Yeah, it makes your hair become a little bit hard or it keeps your hairstyle in for a long time.

163
00:08:37,390 --> 00:08:37,690
That's right.

164
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:41,640
All right, so a lot of vocab here, a lot of things that we've picked up.

