178
00:09:15,610 --> 00:09:17,570
You have no idea what you're talking about.

179
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:25,360
First for my eyes, I have to get eyeliner, an eyelash curler, eye shadow, an eyebrow pencil, and mascara.

180
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:27,480
Then I need to get foundation, liquid foundation.

181
00:09:28,220 --> 00:09:29,340
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

182
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:29,920
Are you nuts?

183
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:31,980
How much is all this going to cost?

184
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:35,040
I'm looking at the price of each one of these little things and it's outrageous.

185
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:37,400
This is basically a crayon.

186
00:09:37,780 --> 00:09:38,550
What about you?

187
00:09:39,190 --> 00:09:43,790
You spend as much money or more on your razors, aftershave, cologne, and gel.

188
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:47,190
Not to mention how much you spend on clothes and-

