218
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:39,000
Okay, so nuts is the important word here.

219
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:42,650
It means crazy or out of your mind.

220
00:11:43,070 --> 00:11:43,450
That's right.

221
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:45,860
So it's another way of saying crazy.

222
00:11:45,860 --> 00:11:50,440
So if you call someone nuts or you say, he's nuts, that means.

223
00:11:50,590 --> 00:11:51,690
Yeah, like don't talk to him.

224
00:11:51,870 --> 00:11:52,130
He's nuts.

225
00:11:52,570 --> 00:11:54,350
Or he always says really dangerous things.

226
00:11:54,650 --> 00:11:55,010
He's nuts.

227
00:11:56,010 --> 00:11:56,970
So he's a little bit crazy.

228
00:11:57,770 --> 00:12:02,510
So it's an adjective as to describe someone that's a little bit crazy or a little bit adventurous maybe.

229
00:12:02,860 --> 00:12:05,320
But in this case, he's not actually saying she's a crazy person.

230
00:12:05,500 --> 00:12:07,680
He's saying, listen, this is so much stuff.

231
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:08,880
Are you crazy?

232
00:12:08,880 --> 00:12:11,680
Or he's basically saying, do you really want to do this?

233
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:12,800
This seems like a bad decision.

234
00:12:13,340 --> 00:12:13,500
Exactly.

235
00:12:14,060 --> 00:12:16,580
So that's why he used the phrase, are you nuts?

236
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:19,400
Okay, so a lot of great stuff there.

